    "source": "M5 Lesson 9 · In-Content Questions",
    "provider": "ICAS",
    "q": "<p>At 1 January 20X7 Nelson Ltd held two financial assets measured at FVTOCI:</p><p>An equity investment, which had a fair value of £320,000 at 31 December 20X6 and £305,000 at 31 December 20X7; and,</p><p>A debt investment, which was disposed of in August 20X7. Between 1 January 20X7 and the disposal date, a fair value gain of £32,000 was recognised on the investment. At the date of disposal, the balance on the FVTOCI revaluation reserve was £64,300 credit.</p><p>What OCI amount(s) should be disclosed in relation to the investments in the year ended 31 December 20X7?</p><div class=\"source-option\"><span class=\"choice-letter\">a)</span><span>A net gain of £81,300 is disclosed in aggregate</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><span class=\"choice-letter\">b)</span><span>Separate disclosure is required of each of: a loss of £15,000, a gain of £32,000, a reclassification adjustment of £64,300</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><span class=\"choice-letter\">c)</span><span>Separate disclosure is required of each of: a loss of £15,000, a gain of £96,300</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><span class=\"choice-letter\">d)</span><span>Separate disclosure is required of each of: a net gain of £17,000 and a reclassification gain of £64,300</span></div>",
    "a": "<p class=\"answer-key\">The correct answer is b.</p><p>A loss of £15,000 is recognised in OCI in respect of the equity investment.</p><p>A gain of £32,000 is recognised in OCI in respect of the debt investment.</p><p>A reclassification adjustment results in a gain to OCI of £64,300.</p><p>Net gains or losses on equity investments at FVTOCI must be disclosed separately from net gains or losses on debt investments at FVTOCI.</p><p>Reclassification adjustments must be disclosed separately from fair value gains or losses in the year.</p>",
    "isHTML": true,
